// Converted 1:1 from apps/web/src/app/workbench/useComposerRuntime.ts (CXU plugins @ f2cb649d). Bulk conversion pass — defects logged, not yet fixed.
// Composer aggregator hook: builds the ComposerCoreInput bundle and wires
// useComposerThreadStart / useComposerPipeline / useProviderTest /
// useComposerAssists / useComposerSend / useFreeCompaction /
// useWorkspaceGitFiles / useWorkbenchOps / useTurnOps, plus context-window
// derivations, theme derivations and the runningThreadIds memo.
// DEFECT: React hooks semantics (useMemo/useEffect/useLayoutEffect, ref
// assignments during render) — plain functions over state struct; memos are
// compute functions, effects are caller-driven, ref writes are explicit.

